<title>SOUTH KOREA: KOOKMIN BANK INTERIM NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>KOOKMIN BANK INTERIM NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 1,204  vs    1,251</p>
<p>    Net					 112.4  vs    100.1</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		     113.2  vs    114.4</p>
<p>    Revenue				 1,774.8  vs  1,353.5</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain			5.1  vs	1.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Kookmin Bank said its share capital increased by 24.17 million shares to 104.64 million during the 12-month period to June through a rights issue.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
